T4-lite includes unmodified Terminal-Bench 4.0.0 task packages under tasks/ and copies of historical native verifier evidence under pilot/.
Upstream dataset: terminal-bench/terminal-bench@4.0.0
Project: https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench
Task registry names and immutable refs are recorded in benchmark/manifest.json.
All upstream attribution and benchmark canaries are retained. This project does not assert ownership of, or relicense, upstream task content. Refer to upstream terms for redistribution.
Benchmark tasks, source solutions, hidden tests and historical evidence are evaluator material and must not be used as model training data.
